                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": ". fopub uses Java and the Gradle build tool to wrap the DocBook toolchain. The only prerequisite to perform the DocBook to PDF conversion using fopub is a Java Development Kit (JDK), which provides the Java runtime."
