                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "The benefit of fopub is that it’s preconfigured to convert DocBook with AsciiDoc processing instructions. The stylesheet it provides also smooths out some of the rough edges of the visual styling provided by the DocBook toolchain. However, the project is no longer actively maintained, so keep that in mind when deciding whether to use it. As an alternative, you may give "
